      "name": "QuickThrow",
      "slug": "quickthrow",
      "teaser": "Instantly throw grenades without equipping them (pre-0.12.12), with the option to perform a short throw on demand and a fallback key to use the vanilla throwing behavior when needed.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2945.jpg",
      "downloads": 3748,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p>This mod restores the deprecated “Fast Grenade Throw” mechanic from earlier Tarkov versions (&lt;0.12.12), allowing you to <strong>instantly throw a grenade</strong> without having to equip it first.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Fast throw grenade</strong>: Pressing the grenade key will throw the grenade instantly, skipping equip animations.</li>\n<li><strong>Low throw override</strong>: Hold ‘<strong>Left Control</strong>’ to <strong>force a short throw</strong> with <strong>QuickThrow feature</strong>. <em>It’s the wrong animation, but the grenade follows a trajectory as if you had thrown it with right-click</em></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Restore Vanilla throw grenade ==&gt; Hold <strong>Left Shift</strong> to equip it first.</p>\n<p>F12 menu to configure 2 keybinds or disable the feature: :</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Low throw ==&gt;</strong> default : Left Alt</li>\n<li><strong>Force Vanilla throw grenade ==&gt; default : Left Shift</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>‘<em>QuickThrow</em>’ folder into BepInEx/plugins.</p>\n",
